reauth_confirm.description:
Cloudflare rejected the token for {zone_name}, or this entry still uses a Global API Key, which is no longer supported. [Create a token]({token_url}) with the following permissions, and add any permission that is missing:
{permissions}
Under **Account Resources**, select your account. Under **Zone Resources**, select the zones that this entry monitors.

error.no_room:
Zone {zone} has {count} custom rules, and its Cloudflare plan allows {limit}. The integration requires {needed} more, and {short} of them cannot be made available automatically: no suitable Block rule can be extended, and no further adjacent rules with the same action and settings can be merged. The existing rules are:
{rules}
Remove or combine {short} rule(s) in the Cloudflare dashboard under Security > Security rules > Custom rules, for example a disabled rule or one that is no longer needed, and then try again. No rule was changed.

